; Plugin loads, the validator's arity / param-type checks accept the
; 10k-element `(vector-sum [...])` call, and the document parses without
; err diagnostics. The actual evaluation never lands a value because
; pushing 10k positional eval frames trips `MAX_FRAMES` (256 × 4) inside
; `Expr.eval` — the `(values …)` block is intentionally absent for that
; reason. The fixture's purpose is the codec / args-encoder stress at
; ~90 KB payload, not the runtime sum; conformance locks that the path
; emits zero err diagnostics on a 10k vector.
(diagnostics)
